      "worked": "The total is $2+5+1=8$ parts.\n$$\\begin{align*}8\\text{ parts}&=180^\\circ\\\\1\\text{ part}&=180^\\circ\\div8=22.5^\\circ\\\\2\\text{ parts}&=2\\times22.5^\\circ=45^\\circ\\\\5\\text{ parts}&=5\\times22.5^\\circ=112.5^\\circ\\\\1\\text{ part}&=22.5^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\nThe angles are $45^\\circ$, $112.5^\\circ$ and $22.5^\\circ$, respectively.",
